  "historyNote": "#7120, eff 10-20-99; ss by #8974, INTERIM, eff 10-6-07, EXPIRED: 4-3-08 New. #9734, eff 6-25-10; ss by #12683, eff 11-30-18; ss by #14253, eff 5-22-25, EXPIRES: 5-22-35",
